From 6adcbc71cccbff0ea605d711ee65cc3dcbb64d4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taniya Das <taniya.das@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 12:40:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] clk: qcom: shikra: add Turing Q6 and LMCU PIL clock
 bring-up

Add the Shikra platform PAS clock unit implementing the peripheral
image loading (PIL) clock sequences for two subsystems:

  - Turing (compute Q6): AON/AHB branch enable, Spark Q6 PLL bring-up
    via qcom_spark_pll_enable(), core RCG programming, boot hand-off,
    and the reset/halt teardown path.
  - LMCU (low-power MCU): branch and RCG setup, processor enable with
    the proc-halt reset dance, and the subsystem restart teardown.

The file is gated on CFG_QCOM_PAS_PTA through the existing qcom clk
sub.mk; wiring it into the Shikra build is done separately when the
platform enables the PAS PTA.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Taniya Das <taniya.das@oss.qualcomm.com>
